      "id": "FR-001",
      "title": "skill-union-assert.sh --params binds a \u0060template\u0060 predicate parameter derived from the provenance document\u0027s top-level \u0060templateRef\u0060, so the six FS.GG.Templates \u0060template in [...]\u0060 predicates evaluate instead of reading the empty string. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
      "text": "skill-union-assert.sh --params binds a \u0060template\u0060 predicate parameter derived from the provenance document\u0027s top-level \u0060templateRef\u0060, so the six FS.GG.Templates \u0060template in [...]\u0060 predicates evaluate instead of reading the empty string. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
